\n<p class="title">Model 94 C-Arm Imaging Table - Platinum Range</p>
\nhis specialist imaging table has been designed for use with a C-Arm fluoroscopy device used to visualize a patient’s anatomy during surgery and diagnosis. The open frame design on one side of the C-Arm Table provides the means to move the table, together with the on-board patient into a position between the upper and lower apertures of the C-Arm equipment. Large central locking castors with steering facility enable the table with “onboard patient” to be easily positioned for use with the imaging equipment. This model provides infinitely smooth electric operation of height, combined with a two-way tilt of +/-5 degrees. The table has manually adjustable backrest/leg rest supports at each end and a padded fold-down side support for patient security.
\n
\n&nbsp;
\n
\n&nbsp;
\n<div class="row"></div>

The Excel evacuation chair makes it possible to evacuate people up to 182 kg via stairs from higher floors in an emergency. The evacuation chair is collapsible, easy to hang and comes with a protective cover. The tracks create a friction that acts as a brake on stairs. This slows down the descent, ensuring smooth, controlled operation. Once the ground floor is reached, the bracket can be folded and the chair can be used as a temporary wheelchair. The sturdy, flat seat and armrests allow the evacuee to be transported comfortably. Thanks to the sturdy armrests and the safety strap for chest and legs the evacuee experiences extra comfort and safety.
\n
\n&nbsp;

